## Quick Reference Tables

### Command Options
| Option | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `--dry-run` | See what would be updated without executing |
| `--only <list>` | Limit update to comma-separated components |
| `--exclude <list>` | Skip specific components |
| `--cleanup` | Run cleanup tasks after updating |

### Supported Components
| Component | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `git` | Pulls latest changes in Git repos |
| `aur` | Updates Arch User Repository packages |
| `flatpak` | Updates Flatpak apps and runtimes |
| `docker` | Pulls new versions of Docker images |
| `cargo` | Updates Rust crates |
| `pip` | Updates Python packages |

